{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108470","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1510847001:0":{"text":"쯧... 더 깎아버렸네.","source_cn":"啧……又多凿了一刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2CD6B35F435802","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510847002:0":{"text":"돌을 조각하는 게 이렇게 어려울 줄이야. 이래서 <style=\"highlight\">루나애니가 조각상으로 변함없는 사랑을 증명하는 거였군</style>. ","source_cn":"没想到石雕居然这么难做，难怪<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD028F78F76898E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510847003:0":{"text":"루가 내가 자기를 이렇게 조각해 놓은 걸 보면... 에휴, 나도 마법을 쓸 수 있었으면 좋았을 텐데.","source_cn":"露要是看到我把她雕成这副样子……唉，要是我也会魔法就好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C6B45EB5016A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510847004:0":{"text":"분명 <style=\"highlight\">이런 미완성품을 완성품으로 만들 수 있는</style> 마법이 있을 거야.","source_cn":"肯定有什么魔法能<style=highlight>把这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D97AEA60E3274D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510847005:0":{"text":"일단 침착하자. 조각은 조급해한다고 될 게 아니니까...","source_cn":"算了，珀尔修斯，还是先静下心来吧。这件事不能急躁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5C75400F3CA841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510847006:0":{"text":"환영이 또 사라졌네? 근데 기믹을 풀 때 쓸 기억의 구슬이 나타나지 않았어.","source_cn":"幻象又消失了？但是地上没出现破解机关用的记忆球。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D5756E9172FDA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510847007:1":{"text":"어떻게 된 거야... 우리더러 페르세우스를 대신해 정표를 만들라는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"什么意思……不会要我们帮他做定情信物吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F41221487B43CFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1510847007":{"text":"어떻게 된 거야... 우리더러 페르세우스를 대신해 정표를 만들라는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"什么意思……不会要我们帮他做定情信物吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F41221487B43CFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510847008:1":{"text":"이번 기억의 구슬 속에는 페르세우스가 만든 조각상이 들어있을 것 같아요. ","source_cn":"我猜，这次的记忆球里会装着珀尔修斯雕刻的石雕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FFC7C124CE81260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510847009:1":{"text":"주변에 미완성된 조각품이 꽤 많이 있으니, 쓸만한 조각품을 골라서 조합해 봐요. ","source_cn":"周围有不少半成品的残块，我们挑一些可用的拼凑起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D292E0CB6E164B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510847010:1":{"text":"...귀찮아죽겠네!","source_cn":"……麻烦死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC76D07A54EEE9306","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"페르세우스가 말했잖아. 마법으로 돌조각을 조합하라고 ","source_cn":"他都说了，用魔法拼好石雕","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62CF6419EFE0CF3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"페르세우스가 말했잖아. 마법으로 돌조각을 조합하라고 ","female":"페르세우스가 말했잖아. 마법으로 돌조각을 조합하라고 ","variant_male_record_index":"74778","variant_female_record_index":"74779","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"발버둥 그만 치고, 운명을 받아들여","source_cn":"放弃挣扎，认命吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDCEDF1EC4619E9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"발버둥 그만 치고, 운명을 받아들여","female":"발버둥 그만 치고, 운명을 받아들여","variant_male_record_index":"74780","variant_female_record_index":"74781","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}